        <h3>SpectraPanel series</h3>
        <p>Compare Basic, Pro and Elite tiers across available sizes. Review wavelengths, irradiance measurements, controls, mounting and coverage.</p>
        <b>Explore SpectraPanel ↗</b>
      </a>
      <a class="category-card wrap-card" href={affiliateFor(spectraWrap)} target="_blank" rel="sponsored nofollow noopener noreferrer">
        <img class="category-image" src="https://flikeze.com/cdn/shop/files/3_7cf8d9d1-8650-49ec-a118-f267f55ade22.jpg?v=1783916277&width=900" alt="FliKEZE SpectraWrap S2 full-body wrap" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
        <span class="category-index">02 / FULL-BODY LIGHT THERAPY</span>
        <h3>Wraps &amp; blankets</h3>
        <p>Explore the SpectraWrap S2 full-body wrap format. Compare coverage, LED count, controls, size and storage needs.</p>
        <b>Explore SpectraWrap S2 ↗</b>
      </a>
      <a class="category-card mat-card" href={affiliateFor(bodyCollection)} target="_blank" rel="sponsored nofollow noopener noreferrer">
        <img class="category-image" src="https://flikeze.com/cdn/shop/files/17_875163e9-f54b-47af-92e0-07b3271f79d6.jpg?v=1783914221&width=900" alt="FliKEZE NeoMat M1 wellness mat" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
        <span class="category-index">03 / WELLNESS &amp; RECOVERY</span>
        <h3>Mats &amp; recovery products</h3>
        <p>Review mat-style products such as NeoMat M1 alongside recovery-focused equipment. Check dimensions, setup and intended use.</p>
        <b>Explore recovery products ↗</b>
      </a>
      <a class="category-card skin-card" href={affiliateFor(skinCollection)} target="_blank" rel="sponsored nofollow noopener noreferrer">
        <img class="category-image" src="https://flikeze.com/cdn/shop/files/FliKEZE-PhotonMask-Quint-Flikeze-235792464.jpg?v=1778083385&width=900" alt="FliKEZE PhotonMask Quint LED face mask" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
        <span class="category-index">04 / BEAUTY &amp; SKINCARE</span>
        <h3>LED masks &amp; facial devices</h3>
        <p>Explore PhotonMask Quint and facial devices such as VacuLift Trio. Compare modes, fit, cleaning and usage instructions.</p>
        <b>Explore beauty devices ↗</b>
      </a>
      <a class="category-card neck-card" href={affiliateFor(neckCollection)} target="_blank" rel="sponsored nofollow noopener noreferrer">
        <img class="category-image" src="https://flikeze.com/cdn/shop/files/FliKEZE-NeoNeck-Air-FliKEZE-434810229.jpg?v=1792403850&width=900" alt="FliKEZE NeoNeck Air neck device" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
        <span class="category-index">05 / NECK &amp; SHOULDER RELIEF</span>
        <h3>Neck support devices</h3>
        <p>Compare NeoNeck and NeoNeck Air by their support design, heat settings, light features, power and fit.</p>
        <b>Explore neck products ↗</b>
      </a>
      <a class="category-card back-card" href={affiliateFor(backCollection)} target="_blank" rel="sponsored nofollow noopener noreferrer">
        <img class="category-image" src="https://flikeze.com/cdn/shop/files/1_8_3.jpg?v=1778751205&width=900" alt="FliKEZE NeoBack Air back comfort device" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
        <span class="category-index">06 / BACK COMFORT</span>
        <h3>Lumbar &amp; back devices</h3>
        <p>Explore NeoBack Air and related products. Check the support format, heat, massage settings, fit and usage guidance.</p>
        <b>Explore back products ↗</b>
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="spectrapanel" class="panel-guide">
