      </div>
      <a class="button button-light" href={affiliateFor(panelCollection)} target="_blank" rel="sponsored nofollow noopener noreferrer">View SpectraPanel range ↗</a>
    </div>
    <div class="tier-grid">
      <article class="tier-card">
        <span class="tier-label">ENTRY TIER</span>
        <h3>Basic</h3>
        <p>A starting point for shoppers comparing the panel format and the specifications offered in the Basic range.</p>
        <ul><li>Confirm panel dimensions and LED count</li><li>Review wavelengths and operating modes</li><li>Check mounting and control details</li></ul>
        <a href={affiliateFor(basic78)} target="_blank" rel="sponsored nofollow noopener noreferrer">View Basic 78 details ↗</a>
      </article>
      <article class="tier-card tier-featured">
        <span class="tier-label">MID TIER</span>
        <h3>Pro</h3>
        <p>Compare the Pro model against Basic and Elite using the published specifications—not the tier name alone.</p>
        <ul><li>Look for meaningful feature differences</li><li>Compare controls and available settings</li><li>Check the exact size and coverage</li></ul>
        <a href={affiliateFor(panelCollection)} target="_blank" rel="sponsored nofollow noopener noreferrer">Compare Pro models ↗</a>
      </article>
      <article class="tier-card">
        <span class="tier-label">UPPER TIER</span>
        <h3>Elite</h3>
        <p>Review the Elite listing closely to understand which additional features, if any, justify the difference for your needs.</p>
        <ul><li>Compare complete specification sheets</li><li>Verify irradiance and test distance</li><li>Consider footprint, setup and budget</li></ul>
        <a href={affiliateFor(panelCollection)} target="_blank" rel="sponsored nofollow noopener noreferrer">Compare Elite models ↗</a>
      </article>
    </div>
    <p class="panel-footnote">The Basic, Pro and Elite labels are product tiers, not independent evidence of clinical effectiveness or a guarantee that one tier is better for every shopper. Model specifications can vary by size and version.</p>
  </section>

  <section id="featured" class="featured-section">
    <div class="section-heading">
      <p class="eyebrow red">FEATURED PRODUCTS TO RESEARCH</p>
      <h2>Eight FliKEZE products to compare</h2>
      <p>Browse a broader selection across the brand's main categories. These are research examples, not a ranking or a claim that Buy Better Finds has personally tested them.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="product-list">
      {products.map((product) => (
        <article class="product-card">
          <div class="product-image-wrap">
            <a href={affiliateFor(product.url)} target="_blank" rel="sponsored nofollow noopener noreferrer">
              <img src={product.image} alt={product.alt} loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
            </a>
          </div>
          <div class="product-details">
            <p class="product-category"><span>{product.number}</span> {product.category}</p>
            <h3>{product.name}</h3>
            <p>{product.description}</p>
            <div class="consider"><strong>What to compare</strong><span>{product.check}</span></div>
            <a class="product-button" href={affiliateFor(product.url)} target="_blank" rel="sponsored nofollow noopener noreferrer">{product.button} ↗</a>
            <small>Check current price, availability and product terms at FliKEZE.</small>
