    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="buying-guide" class="buying-section">
    <div class="section-heading centered">
      <p class="eyebrow red">A SMARTER SHOPPING CHECKLIST</p>
      <h2>What to check before choosing a wellness device</h2>
      <p>Use this checklist to look beyond product photos and promotional language.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="check-grid">
      <article><span>01</span><div><h3>Exact model &amp; version</h3><p>Confirm the complete model name, size, color and included accessories. Similar product names can refer to different specifications.</p></div></article>
      <article><span>02</span><div><h3>Published specifications</h3><p>For light devices, check wavelengths, irradiance and the distance used for measurements, LED count, modes and timer settings.</p></div></article>
      <article><span>03</span><div><h3>Practical fit &amp; setup</h3><p>Consider dimensions, placement, mounting, power, charging, cleaning and how much storage space the product requires.</p></div></article>
      <article><span>04</span><div><h3>Safety instructions</h3><p>Read the manufacturer's instructions and warnings. Do not use a device outside its stated directions or assume it is suitable for every person.</p></div></article>
      <article><span>05</span><div><h3>Warranty &amp; returns</h3><p>Review the current warranty, return window, exclusions, shipping costs and how customer support handles issues.</p></div></article>
      <article><span>06</span><div><h3>Total value</h3><p>Compare the current price, included items, expected setup needs and the features you will actually use. A discount alone does not establish value.</p></div></article>
    </div>
    <aside class="safety-note"><strong>Important:</strong> Red-light and wellness devices are not a substitute for medical advice, diagnosis or treatment. Review product safety information and consult a qualified healthcare professional if you have questions about whether a device is appropriate for you.</aside>
  </section>

  <section id="offers" class="offer-section">
